<%--
Detail_Sidebar - entity sidebar wrapper: card chrome + stacking rhythm

default content - sidebar blocks (Sidebar_Kpi_Group, View_Fields, action buttons),
stacked with the standard block rhythm.

The single card that holds an entity view's sidebar telemetry. KPIs live at the
TOP (the "At a Glance" pattern), then fact fields, then actions.

Usage:
    <Detail_Sidebar>
        <Sidebar_Kpi_Group> ... </Sidebar_Kpi_Group>
        <View_Fields> ... </View_Fields>
        <button class="btn btn-primary">Edit</button>
    </Detail_Sidebar>
--%>
<Define:Detail_Sidebar extends="View_Section_Abstract" class="View_Section_Abstract card shadow-sm">
    <div class="View_Section_Abstract__stack card-body">
        <%= content() %>
    </div>
</Define:Detail_Sidebar>
